<div class="single-location">
	
	
		<div class="title">
			<div class="title__main-title">
				<h1><span>CONGRESS CENTRE</span></h1>			</div>
		</div>
	
	<section class="section section--margin-big--top h-bg--grey">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-12 col-md-4 col-lg-6 px-0 px-md-3">

																
				</div>
				<div class="col-12 col-md-8 col-lg-6 pl-lg-5">
					<div class="dynamic-content">
						<p>In size, complexity and service level the Congress Centre is Hungary’s premier, high-capacity conference centre. The building offers a total of 15000 sqm event space on three levels. Escalators and elevators provide convenient guest flow between floors. Car-size freight elevators help event logistics. The Congress Centre is equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual technology.</p>
<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="alignleft is-resized"><a href="https://myalbum.com/album/3A34wjzGqSJg/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-72346" src="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Névtelens.png" alt="" width="209" height="67" /></a></figure>
</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-12">
					<div class="dynamic-content dynamic-content--justified">
						
<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-layout-1 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://hungexpo.hu/en/hosted-events/request-for-proposal/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Request for our tailor-made proposal</a></div>
</div>



<div style="height:75px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe title="HUNGEXPO Congress Centre" width="640" height="360" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/s1fRBtS54qo?list=PLbp9N6noZGnwOSyq5t3d47nLeDJAD2s4p" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>



<div style="height:100px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="900" height="675" src="https://preview.hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Hunexpo0916-61.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-71307 size-full" srcset="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Hunexpo0916-61.jpg 900w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Hunexpo0916-61-300x225.jpg 300w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Hunexpo0916-61-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Ground floor</strong></h2>



<p> On arrival guests are welcomed in the 1 000 sqm spacious reception hall surrounded by glass walls with visitor registration and a cloakroom. There is a 2 500 sqm exhibition area with 10 meters internal height on one side of the reception hall which can be divided into three section rooms, up to 6-700 pax theatre style, each. On the other side of the hall there are a total of six rooms for 200 people each and can be connected to 400 and 600 people rooms. In addition, four rooms for 100 people are located here, all section rooms with built-in AV technology. The space in front of the meeting rooms is 1 100 square meters and it is ideal for coffee breaks, popup exhibitions, e-poster sections. </p>
</div></div>



<div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter is-resized"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="461" src="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads//C_foldszint_tablazat_EN-1024x461.png" alt="" class="wp-image-71642" style="width:880px" srcset="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C_foldszint_tablazat_EN-1024x461.png 1024w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C_foldszint_tablazat_EN-300x135.png 300w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C_foldszint_tablazat_EN-768x346.png 768w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C_foldszint_tablazat_EN.png 1540w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure></div>


<div class="wp-block-columns has-2-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<div class="wp-block-button aligncenter"><a class="wp-block-button__link" href="https://vr.hungexpo.hu/?lg=en&amp;detail=c_szekcio_nagy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Virtual tour</a></div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-layout-2 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://hungexpo.hu/en/hosted-events/request-for-proposal/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Request for proposal</a></div>
</div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<div class="wp-block-button aligncenter"><a class="wp-block-button__link" href="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C_foldszint.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Floorplan</a></div>
</div>
</div>



<div style="height:170px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right"><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Gallery Floor</strong></h2>



<p>The gallery level has 16 rooms, 50pax each, located on 1 200 square meters. These rooms can be connected by mobile walls creating 100 to 150 pax rooms for different events. In front of the rooms, the 7 meter wide, 800 m2 large space offers excellent location for coffee breaks.</p>
</div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img decoding="async" width="900" height="675" src="https://preview.hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C-galéria.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-71309 size-full" srcset="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C-galéria.jpg 900w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C-galéria-300x225.jpg 300w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C-galéria-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></figure></div>



<div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter is-resized"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="311" src="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads//C_galeria_tablazat_EN-1024x311.png" alt="" class="wp-image-71647" style="width:880px" srcset="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C_galeria_tablazat_EN-1024x311.png 1024w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C_galeria_tablazat_EN-300x91.png 300w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C_galeria_tablazat_EN-768x234.png 768w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C_galeria_tablazat_EN.png 1381w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure></div>


<div class="wp-block-columns has-2-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-2 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<div class="wp-block-button aligncenter"><a class="wp-block-button__link" href="https://vr.hungexpo.hu/?lg=en&amp;detail=c_szekcio_kicsi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Virtual tour</a></div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-layout-3 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
