<div style="height:170px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img decoding="async" width="900" height="675" src="https://preview.hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Ese_1_day_132.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-71311 size-full" srcset="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Ese_1_day_132.jpg 900w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Ese_1_day_132-300x225.jpg 300w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Ese_1_day_132-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Plenary Floor</strong> <strong>and foyer</strong></h2>



<p>Upstairs is the plenary hall for 2 000 people on 1 900 square meters, surrounded by a lobby area.  The 1 670 sqm foyer opening from the plenary hall is an excellent location for coffee breaks and standing receptions. The plenary hall can be divided into two to three parallel section rooms by mobile walls. The Gala seating system is the special feature of this hall: with the revolving seats, the hall can be easily and time-efficiently converted from theatre style to auditorium style or to a gala seating on a flat floor. Altogether there are 8 pre-programmed layout configurations with different settings and capacities.</p>
</div></div>



<div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


