<div style="height:170px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img decoding="async" width="900" height="675" src="https://preview.hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Hunexpo0916-3-2.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-71081 size-full" srcset="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Hunexpo0916-3-2.jpg 900w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Hunexpo0916-3-2-300x225.jpg 300w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/Hunexpo0916-3-2-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Roof terrace</strong></h2>



<p>A really nice and unique feature: the 2 350 sqm roof terrace above the exhibition space, which is a great outdoor space for receptions, coffee breaks when weather permits.</p>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-columns has-2-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-4 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<div class="wp-block-button aligncenter"><a class="wp-block-button__link" href="https://vr.hungexpo.hu/?lg=en&amp;detail=c_terasz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Virtual tour</a></div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<div class="wp-block-button aligncenter"><a class="wp-block-button__link" href="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/C_terasz_EN.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Floorplan</a></div>
</div>
</div>



<div style="height:170px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right"><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<p class="has-large-font-size"><strong>Headbuilding</strong></p>



<p>The headbuilding is connected to the exhibition area of the congress centre and has 4 levels. There are a total of 9 offices of 33-45 sqm on 2 floors above the 371 square meter ground floor foyer. The top floor of the headbuilding is connected to the roof terrace. The building is equipped with a car size freight elevator.</p>
</div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img decoding="async" width="900" height="675" src="https://preview.hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/ABP0139.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-71478 size-full" srcset="https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/ABP0139.jpg 900w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/ABP0139-300x225.jpg 300w, https://hungexpo.hu/wp-content/uploads/ABP0139-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></figure></div>



